; Plugin loads, dispatches `(vec3-length [3.0 4.0 0.0])` into
; `wasm:vec3_length`, plugin frames the L2 norm (`5.0`) back as a
; number, host decodes against the declared `:result number`. The
; `(values …)` block locks the round-trip value in addition to the
; clean diagnostic stream.
(diagnostics)
(values
  (value :index 0 :result 5.0))
